Z||000011||sully5||05-24-2000||07:12 PM||||Hey yall, I found a site a while back called Fiero Shows 2000. The event in Louisville is listed there. Dates are July 27-29, with the show date July 29. A couple of contacts are listed: Phil Huff, Fierophillhuff@fieroowners.com,and a local contact of Jennifer Lindsey, Mid-America Fieros: fierojen@apex.net. Hope this helps. Sully.<P>||||reg||1
